WEBVTT

00:13:28.347 --> 00:13:31.337
that we can trigger
and build these complex organs

00:13:31.361 --> 00:13:34.435
long before we actually know
how to micromanage the process

00:13:34.459 --> 00:13:35.877
at the cellular level.

00:13:35.901 --> 00:13:40.743
CA: So as you've started to get
to learn this electrical layer

00:13:40.767 --> 00:13:41.948
and what it can do,

00:13:41.972 --> 00:13:44.499
you've been able to create --

00:13:44.523 --> 00:13:48.062
is it fair to say it's almost
like a new, a novel life-form,

00:13:48.086 --> 00:13:49.256
called a xenobot?

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:51.041
Talk to me about xenobots.

00:13:51.065 --> 00:13:52.216
ML: Right.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:56.530
So if you think about this,
this leads to a really strange prediction.

00:13:56.554 --> 00:14:00.510
If the cells are really willing to build
towards a specific map,